  "comment": "\"if <file> exists\" must ask file.exists, not test the quoted name as truthy text. missing.json does not\nexist, so %seen% is never set. With the bug (condition.if(Left=\"missing.json\")), the name is truthy text\nand %seen% gets set — this test goes red.",
